--- /dev/null
+++ 2/.changeset/neoism-frame-pacing.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+"@gpuix/native": patch
+---
+
+Use output-aware Wayland retry timing and publish coherent native frame samples.
+
+Avoid cloning unchanged custom properties and move canvas payload strings into their cache; add opt-in CPU-side GPU submission and canvas parsing diagnostics.
+
+Reuse unchanged raster canvas paint through GPUI cached views and stop invalidating
+all views for ordinary root mutations. Normalize Wayland continuous-axis travel
+to the original frontend without changing discrete wheel behavior.
+
+Avoid redundant root notifications after changed canvas lists already paint.
+Send platform window titles only when changed and add opt-in tree phase timings.
+Batch disjoint consecutive canvas images to reduce bounds-tree insertion work.
